I stand at my window.
I look out at Copenhagen.
It is a very big city.
There are many people on the street.
And there are many bicycles.
The sky is grey.
It is cold today.
At home in Mexico it is not cold.
It is warm there.
There is also sun there.
I think about my family.
I think about my mother.
I think about my father.
I am here alone.
